      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Come enjoy an evening of fabulous, Pride-inspired music with the Cincinnati Symphony Orchestra, featuring a special performance by Queen City Cabaret! Sarah and Matthew will join the CSO on the ICON Festival Stage at Smale Park to perform some beloved Cole Porter favorites. Celebrate Pride with QCC"
      }
