        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join QCC for an evening of vintage jazz and pop tunes at The Orbit Room, a cozy neighborhood bar in the historic Apotheke building in Over-the-Rhine. Pop in for a drink and fabulous music 8pm-11pm."
      }
