      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Queen City Cabaret is back at Caffe Vivace with an evening of music celebrating Cincinnati’s hometown songstress, Rosemary Clooney!  Click here to reserve your tickets!   Beginning with her sister act on Cincinnati’s own WLW radio station in the 1940s and culminating in a legendary career as a 20th-"
