        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join Matthew and Sarah on Monday, September 29, for some “Jazz at the Park.” Sip on a cocktail and enjoy a beautiful summer evening of vintage standards and pop tunes at OTR’s Washington Park Porch. Admission is free!"
      }
