        "@value": "A COZY CHRISTMAS  is back—brighter, warmer, and yes, even cozier than last year! Join Queen City Cabaret and The Carnegie for an evening that wraps you in the glow of holiday lights, the sound of timeless carols, and the joy of traditions old and new."
